{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02985","headline":"杂诗五首 二 · 张九龄","name":"杂诗五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萝茑必有托，风霜不能落。\n酷在兰将蕙，甘从葵与藿。\n运命虽爲宰，寒暑自回薄。\n悠悠天地间，委顺无不乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}